    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34237" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">păvĭmento</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. a.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To cover with a pavement</i>, <i>to
				pave</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porticus pavimentata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 3, 1, 1</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. Dom. 44, 116</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 6, 5,
				3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To make a pavement</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 4,
				5, § 15</span></i>.</div>
